  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh - Establishing a Thinking and Working Politically Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Thinking and Working Politically Facility will support the UK&#x2019;s objective of building state capacity in Bangladesh through modern partnerships. The TWP Facility will provide a deeper understanding of political economy, institutions and support for local reform  and processes will help to unlock system strengthening and deepen state capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
